    <string name="status_reset_title">Reset without the backup?</string>
    <string name="status_reset_body">Turns sound and vibration back on for every app, without using the backup. Use this if apps are still muted after Restore all.\n\nA few categories that are meant to be quiet may start making sound. You can mute those by hand.\n\nThen tap Run now to turn vibration off again.</string>
