    <string name="explainer_title">What QuietBuzz changes</string>
    <string name="explainer_body">Android only lets QuietBuzz change the notification categories listed under each app. Some phones, like Samsung, also show a switch at the top of the page, such as \"Sound and vibration\". QuietBuzz can\'t change that one, so it may still look on. Don\'t worry: vibration is still off.</string>
